{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_07_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b19ab8d3da300ebacee47b3a61898377c939a862df73c671d6366b594aa904b0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca6273539fbb7cd626fe91279df42df2c60bc5b752abe2de9717ed732a9e0fae",
      "text": "那时候那家唱片店发来的工作委托？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebc60e507532a17bd42a04126470012ab9d14e4cdfa1eeb7e17a7d8327717c31",
      "text": "是的！店员似乎对各位当时的应对\n非常感动……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07f9ecab9d42eb95fcf58424f3a269650daedf3e80a45408ea083b64dc6e7158",
      "text": "特意去向上司争取，\n为各位争取到了这份工作！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5bef3e5bd10c20f09ae1a542a6258be722555cc7d8bfa1129f0ffd0b5e04173",
      "text": "哦—！那么，\n又能让当时的店员露出笑容了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:340215b742c2f6614af582a492cabc9e1e1a0a16b58acba1ad0ff9bb83b725f7",
      "text": "呵呵，只要我们努力，肯定可以的。\n那么，工作的内容是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8260ca98c41c3a58207f7bfe7aac00e84f8025e30a98c6b9dbaded6018f82ba4",
      "text": "是的。对方希望各位担任一日店长，\n并负责店内广播。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:106a3d1d11118a47ee93521f38286e30492be010e50d85f5ef44e60e68f59ef4",
      "text": "店内、广播……？\n恭二你们以前做过吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9082287bf33b6ee1fe089405bec7719362dea633d9fd3bfe98229ac0ba346059",
      "text": "不……我顶多只在便利店里\n做过店内招揽客人的吆喝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80225c9d849950858b5d05f18f5ae1999585721244a2f2e0b6f08c3167a9f57c",
      "text": "我也差不多吧。\n顶多也就是录过花店电话留言用的提示音而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0aac89af9fcf69d71319677fe5e3bc87b4a14271c92dbc2bb2ed1e5c390ceed",
      "text": "嗯……我也不太懂。\n但是，我想做店内广播的工作……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
